msgctxt "ST_Weapons,Weapon_Slot_Primary"
msgid "Primary"
msgstr "Primario"

#. Key:	Weapon_Slot_Secondary
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,Weapon_Slot_Secondary"
msgid "Secondary"
msgstr "Secondario"

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_BacklineSlugger		
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_BacklineSlugger\t\t"
msgid "Admired for its armor penetration capabilities, this former battle rifle has been cut down to pistol size and is now only issued to troops not directly involved in combat. The cartridge, however, has remained the same - reducing cost, barrel length, ammo consumption and wrist integrity all in one compact, light package. "
msgstr "Un ex-fucile con un'ottima penetrazione dell'armatura ridotto alle dimensioni di una pistola e fornito alle truppe in retroguardia.\r\nCompatto, leggero, economico e con la stessa cartuccia di una volta, tutto al modico prezzo di una \"lieve\" frattura al polso."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_BrassTack				
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_BrassTack\t\t\t\t"
msgid "Capable of a blistering rate of fire, this SMG has the capability to reign its domain of close range encounters as a king.\r\nThough here, one is not born a king.\r\nThis weapon's fire rate will cut down nigh anyone, but its low capacity and staggering recoil will foil an inexperienced wielder. Therefore, if you long for the crown, you must first train."
msgstr "La velocità di fuoco di questa mitraglietta può far fronte a chiunque, e ciò la rende la regina indiscussa del combattimento ravvicinato.\r\nMa nessuno nasce degno della corona.\r\nGli inesperti verranno fregati dal potente rinculo e la piccola dimensione del caricatore, ma la corona premia sempre il più tenace."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_BuckPistol				
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_BuckPistol\t\t\t\t"
msgid "This light-weight automatic shotgun hits like a truck and, if you're not careful, will send it flying out of your hand just as fast. But if you can handle its recoil, your opponents certainly won't be able to handle the ammunition causing it."
msgstr "Cosa fa più male? Un camion che ti prende in pieno o i pallettoni di questa pistola? La risposta non è semplice, ma mentre ci rifletti ricordati di tenerla stretta tra le mani: tende a volare via molto spesso."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_Dagger					
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_Dagger\t\t\t\t\t"
msgid "The most basic, yet critical implement of any soldier. The dagger does its duty not only plunging deep into the flesh of our enemies, but also by saving your life in everyday situations - be it peeling, cutting, opening cans or as a replacement of a fork - this remarkable, simple tool is there to assist you faithfully all the way."
msgstr "Come fare senza pugnale!\r\nOltre a sfilettare i tuoi nemici come sardine puoi anche pelare le patate ed usarlo come forchetta!\r\nProvalo, non riuscirai a farne a meno!"

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_Fists					
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_Fists\t\t\t\t\t"
msgid "High speed, low drag. Why would I say so? Because sometimes extra mobility and a jawbreaker per side is better than anything a sidearm could provide."
msgstr "Passo svelto e poche ciance.\r\nIl motivo? Perchè a volte un pò di mobilità in piu e due spaccadenti battono qualsiasi pistola."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_Flamer					
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_Flamer\t\t\t\t\t"
msgid "Improvised as it may be, the flamer nonetheless excels in combat and has quickly become a troop favorite. Assembled from scraps of our glorious fleet, the flamer channels the spirit of these fallen vessels once more, as our soldiers charge through concealing smoke, spraying fiery death at all that may oppose us. "
msgstr "Tanti si chiedono come un'arma improvvisata con dei rottami di navicella sia diventata una delle preferite tra le truppe.\r\nMa nessuno si chiede come mai scappano tutti alla prima vista di una fiamma.\r\nChe strano il mondo, non è vero?"

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_GoldenStandard			
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_GoldenStandard\t\t\t"
msgid "Forged from the strength of steel, this weapon reflects the glory of your ancestors in every milimetre of its amethyst coating - and your worthiness to wield it. Use it to destroy those that would see its magnificence fade."
msgstr "La leggenda narra che nell'ametista di quest'arma si intraveda l'antica gloria dei nostri avi.\r\nNon deluderli. Distruggi chiunque ti si opponga."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_GrenadeLauncher		
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_GrenadeLauncher\t\t"
msgid "A double barreled design, based on the Nancoid standard-issue grenade launcher from the great war. Though it has been modified significantly, it still evokes imperial pride in great war veterans, bringing memories of the original's legendary performance on the battlefield."
msgstr "Un modello a doppia canna, che pur non essendo la versione originale della grande guerra, fa scendere una lacrimuccia ai veterani di ogni età."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_HealingSyringes		
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_HealingSyringes\t\t"
msgid "A highly potent stimulant that suppresses pain and accelerates blood coagulation.\r\nNo negative side effects have ever been observed."
msgstr "Una sostanza potentissima, in grado di sopprimere il dolore ed accellerare la coagulazione sanguigna.\r\nNon sono mai stati osservati effetti collaterali."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_ImpGrenade				
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_ImpGrenade\t\t\t\t"
msgid "The weapon of choice for the brave, the grenade has served extensively in this war. One simple turn of the detonator switch is enough to destroy all enemy morale - and you've got 3 in your bag."
msgstr "The weapon of choice for the brave, the grenade has served extensively in this war. One simple turn of the detonator switch is enough to destroy all enemy morale - and you've got 3 in your bag."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_Lmg					
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_Lmg\t\t\t\t\t"
msgid "Yes, it's heavy. But it is by this heavy steel that the lives of you and your brothers in arms are carried. Whether it classifies as a machine gun or an autocannon is irrelevant, it fires deadly projectiles at the enemy at such a rate that they will be forced into cover. And if they are not, there is plenty of room left where this metal slug will send them."
msgstr "C'è chi dice che è troppo pesante e chi dice che è troppo potente.\r\nI suoi proiettili sfrecciano tra i nemici alla velocità della luce: non possono fare altro che correre al riparo.\r\nE se non lo faranno, questo ammasso d'acciaio li spazzerà via in un batter d'occhio."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_OverdriveModule		
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_OverdriveModule\t\t"
msgid "Starting as an illegal modification made by narcotic addicts, the \"OD module\" has now become a daring new part of human attack tactics. The module, integrated into a sturdy breastplate, turns the user into an unstoppable killing machine by freely dispensing the suit's life-saving drugs, otherwise reserved for emergency purposes."
msgstr "\"Una modifica illegale, creata dai tossicodipendenti per ammazzare il tempo\".\r\nCosì è scritto nella lettera d'opposizione all'adozione del modulo nell'arsenale ufficiale dell'esercito.\r\nTroppo tardi."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_SmokeGrenade			
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_SmokeGrenade\t\t\t"
msgid "Where there's smoke, there's fire."
msgstr "Dov'è c'è fumo, qualcosa brucia."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_StockRifle				
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_StockRifle\t\t\t\t"
msgid "Towering as a monument to ingenious human engineering, this fine assault rifle, produced and deployed in the great war over 200 years ago, has once again become the main armament of human soldiers. Designed for maximum flexibility, it is a mighty force multiplier to all that have the privilege to wield it."
msgstr "\"L'apice dell'ingegneria umana\"\r\n\"Il colosso della sovrapproduzione\"\r\n\"L'arma più pratica che esista\"\r\n\"Il simbolo della Coalizione\"\r\nNomi diversi, stesso fucile, stessa garanzia da oltre 200 anni."

#. Key:	WeaponDesc_VargaRevolver			
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
#: /Game/StringTables/ST_Weapons.ST_Weapons
msgctxt "ST_Weapons,WeaponDesc_VargaRevolver\t\t\t"
msgid "Revered for its rich history of over 350 years - spanning back to the colonization era - the Varga still widely remains in use today, owing to its deadly combination of stopping power and accuracy."
msgstr "Questa combinazione letale di potenza e precisione circola nella Coalizione fin dal periodo coloniale. E nonostante siano passati più di 350 anni, il revolver di Varga rimane sempre la prima scelta per chi sa dove mirare."

